  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline O-TORO TOUR is a firmer, more control-oriented evolution of the original O-TORO, refined with former ATP Top 25 professional Steve Johnson for advanced players and higher swing speeds. It is approximately 15% stiffer than standard O-TORO, increasing directional control, stringbed stability and durability while retaining the hexagonal profile and high spin potential of the original. Manufacturer-reported laboratory testing places its stiffness in a similar class to Luxilon 4G and Babolat RPM Blast while reporting higher spin and comfort than both. O-TORO TOUR is particularly well suited to powerful players, softer-flex racquets and low-tension setups.",

    "zh": "Toroline O-TORO TOUR 是标准 O-TORO 的更硬、更偏控制版本，由前 ATP 世界前25球员 Steve Johnson 继续参与优化，主要面向高级及比赛型球员。其刚性相比标准 O-TORO 约提高 15%，因此在高速挥拍下能够提供更强的方向控制、线床稳定性和耐久表现，同时保留六边形结构带来的高旋转能力。Toroline 表示其刚性水平与 Luxilon 4G 和 Babolat RPM Blast 接近，但实验室测试中的旋转和舒适表现均高于这两款对比球线。它尤其适合高速挥拍球员、偏柔软拍框以及低磅穿线方案。"
  },

